    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High difficulty bullet-hell 2D scrolling action game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the cartoons and check out the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Witches, fairies and goddesses</strong>. Use the three main characters to conquer the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two-person cooperative play <strong>offers more scope for strategy by making full use of powerful combined techniques!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>game Stream Free</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No storyline Is Allowed After the Last Boss.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is a URL at the bottom of the page for a video with instructions on how to defeat the boss.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500Atry<strong>X              : Attack.\u3000\uff08Bullets stuck in the wall become footholds.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>X (long Press) : Strong Attack[/h2]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A              : Jump[/h2]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A (aerial)   : 2-jumps[/h2]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Y              : Special Technique[/h2]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>                 (100 Guesses)[/h2]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2193+Y\u3000\u3000\uff1a Special Technique[/h2]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  \u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000 (60 Guesses)[/h2]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000not Yet Mastered.[/h2]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>B              : ???[/h2]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000not Yet Time to Use[/h2]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>L1             : Dash[/h2]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2193             : Crouching.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000There may be scenes that require this action as well.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2193B             : Going down a step.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500Fufa<strong>\uff38\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\uff1aattack[/h2]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\uff38\uff08long Press\uff09\uff1astrong Attack[/h2]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\uff38charge\uff59\u3000\u3000\u3000\uff1asuper Palm  Attack[/h2]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\uff21\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\uff1aflight[/h2]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\uff39\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\uff1apalm  Attack[/h2]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\uff22\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\uff1aavoidance[/h2]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\uff2c\uff11\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\uff1aseed Select[/h2]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\uff32\uff11\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\uff1aseed Select[/h2]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On the Ground\u2193 \uff1arecovery Of Vitality[/h2]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2193             \u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000: Crouching.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000There may be scenes that require this action as well.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2193B         \u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000   : Going down a step.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragra